  "body": "Whether you are stepping onto the property ladder, growing your investment portfolio, or looking for a practical family home, this well-designed home offers outstanding value and a layout that simply works.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, complete with a stylish feature TV wall and seamless flow to two outdoor decks, perfect for entertaining, relaxing in the sun, or enjoying family gatherings throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThe flexible four-bedroom layout, including two master bedrooms with ensuites, making it ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers, or even flatmates. The remaining bedrooms are well-serviced by a family bathroom, creating a functional setup for busy households.\r\n\r\nDesigned with family living in mind, the home offers excellent separation between bedrooms while keeping the main living spaces connected and welcoming. The indoor-outdoor flow is effortless, giving everyone plenty of room to enjoy both inside and out.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Four bedrooms, including two master with ensuites\r\n• Two sunny outdoor decks\r\n• Spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen\r\n• Stylish feature TV wall\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Family-friendly layout with great separation of space\r\n• Affordable option for first-home buyers and investors\r\n\r\nContact us today for your private viewing or attend our Open Home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
